<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 43 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 15% of normal in October to November and 6% in November to December. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 23% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, with grid 15414 at 28%.</p>"}
